msgctxt "112"
msgid "I don't think anyone was able to photograph me. Very impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Yes. The bodyguard did his utmost to keep you safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I believe it. And I'd like you to give this to that special someone in your "
"life, darling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You got an <Color:8>Italian Perfume<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I'll just say goodbye to my manager... You'll take care of the rest for me, "
"won't you? Oh, and come pick me up in the morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Thank you, truly. You managed to keep those vultures from snapping a single "
"shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "And here's that handsome payment I promised you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "You got <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"(Keep your lips sealed about Ms. Takahashi and her new host friend, all "
"right?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Thanks for doing this. Farewell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

